{
  "name": "Turn a Telegram message into an AI short video, checked against each network before and after rendering",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Telegram idea → AI short video → approved → queued\n\nFor creators with ideas on the go: text one to your bot, get a vertical clip back, tap Approve, and it is queued for YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels and TikTok.\n\n### How it works\n1. Claude turns an idea from your own chat into a video prompt, a caption and a YouTube title.\n2. Before any money is spent, Preflight checks the caption and planned clip against each channel's rules. A refusal comes back with the reason.\n3. Kling renders the clip on fal.ai (up to about ten minutes).\n4. Preflight measures the real file and checks it again.\n5. The bot sends the clip with Approve and Skip. Approve queues it for each channel's next free slot.\n\n### Setup\n1. Needs the verified community node **Preflight** ([n8n-nodes-preflight](https://www.npmjs.com/package/n8n-nodes-preflight) 0.1.1 or later): search for Preflight in the nodes panel and choose Install. Tested on self-hosted n8n 2.43.\n2. In [Preflight](https://preflight.social) (the free plan works), connect your social accounts, then create an API key under Settings → API keys with the scopes `posts:read`, `posts:write`, `posts:publish`, `media:read` and `media:write`. Add it as a **Preflight API** credential.\n3. Create a bot with @BotFather and add its token as a Telegram credential.\n4. Add an Anthropic credential to **Claude**, and your fal.ai key as Header Auth (`Authorization`: `Key YOUR_FAL_KEY`).\n5. In **Configuration**, set your channels and chat ID (message the bot once: it is `message.chat.id` in the trigger's output).\n\n### Customization\n- Each clip costs money on fal.ai: Kling 2.6 Pro is $0.07 per second, $0.14 with **withSound** on. Kling takes 5 or 10 **seconds**. For another model change **falModel** and **Start the render**.\n- TikTok goes to the inbox as **Only me** until you change the TikTok options.",
        "height": 1040,
        "width": 600,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "945c76ad-0f8c-5058-a365-84813de018dc",
      "name": "Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -800,
        -460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Your idea, from your chat only\nAnyone can message a bot. Messages from other chats are ignored, so nobody else can spend your render credits.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 960,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "aa539df9-8f31-59ad-80db-541f0f94db4e",
      "name": "Section: idea",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Plan, then check for free\nThe caption and the planned clip are checked before rendering, so a post a network would refuse never costs a render.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1080,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "6fe2a374-b300-5927-a6ff-5794035dacda",
      "name": "Section: plan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        940,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 3. Render and wait\nfal.ai queues the job. The loop checks every 20 seconds and gives up after about ten minutes.",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 1060,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "0f52691b-e130-5d82-a093-ba358fb3c422",
      "name": "Section: render",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2060,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 4. Check the real file\nLength, frame rate, aspect ratio and size come from the file itself, not from what was asked for.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 1040,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "0348471d-90b2-51c3-910f-e6d8486265de",
      "name": "Section: check file",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3140,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 5. You approve, then it is queued\nThe idempotency key is the file, so approving twice never makes two posts. Skip leaves nothing behind but the file in Preflight.",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 1380,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "616b860f-8e16-51f0-b073-924751471db2",
